                            <p class="faqHeading">What is included in the programme fee</p>

                            <img  src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-1">All domestic travel, accommodation, meals, company visits, excursions, entry tickets, 
                            and 24/7 support are included. International flights and personal insurance are excluded.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Which cities does the immersion cover?
                            </p>

