                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-3">Participants will engage with family enterprises, startups, financial hubs, tech companies, and cultural sectors.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-4">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Is this programme suitable for international students?
                            </p>

                            <img  src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-4">Yes, it is designed especially for international undergraduates, postgraduates, early professionals, and executive education participants.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-5">
